{
    "title": "Salams - Where Muslims Meet",
    "description": "Salams is about bringing Muslims together. Salams is a Muslim dating, friendship and networking app with nearly 4 million Muslims worldwide. Salams has helped over 460,000 Muslim couples and friends. Hamdullah!\r\n\r\n* Salams Love \u2192 Muslim Marriage (i.e. Muslim dating, halal dating)\r\n* Salams Connect \u2192 Muslim friendship and networking\r\nDownload Salams and start matching today to find a Muslim spouse or friend.\r\n\r\nSalams makes Muslim dating (1) halal (2) simple (3) personal (4) safe and secure. Some Salams features to enjoy:\r\n* Swipe right if you\u2019re interested or left if you\u2019re not\r\n* In-depth profiles with a person\u2019s sect, education, career, height, prayer levels and more!\r\n* Free Audio/ video calling\r\n* Unlimited messages, matches and calling\r\n* User verification process with selfie verification and GPS location\r\n* User Endorsements are given by other users to rate profile quality\r\n* Screenshot stopper for private dating\r\nSalams app features are designed for quality halal conversations. Swipes are anonymous and you\u2019re only matched with someone if they swipe right on you too. When you match, we\u2019ll notify you both and you can start dating!\r\n\r\nWe recommend exploring our Salams Gold or Salams Diamond memberships to speed up your matrimonial journey!\r\n* Over 17 filters to find the right partner\r\n* Profile Boosts to help you stand out from the crowd\r\n* Profile Insights that show where you\u2019re most popular, the total number of swipes and more\r\n* Anti-Ghost feature to improve responsiveness with your matches\r\n* Custom Profile Reviews from our experts to improve your dating profile\r\n* Telegrams are like love notes for a more personal touch... and more!\r\n\r\nSalams welcomes all Muslims into a respectful, positive space! Black Muslim, Arab Muslim, Turkish Muslim, Desi Muslim, Asian Muslim or any other ethnicity in this world? Born Muslim or a Muslim revert/ convert or just interested in meeting Muslims? Sunni, Shia, Ahmadi, Ibadi, Bohra or Bahai? Phone call with her Dad? Require a Wali or Just Muslim? Rishta? Shaadi? Nikah? However, you name it. Salams is the app for you!\r\n\r\nMuslims are diverse and so are their ideal relationship paths. Find someone that fits yours and InshAllah you complete half your deen with us!\r\n\r\nSalams has been featured in The New York Times, Vice, The Washington Post, The Jimmy Kimmel Show, The Daily Beast, Der Spiegel and more as a popular approach for Muslim dating!\r\n\r\nHow does Salams Love work? Salams Love is for Muslim Dating.\r\n* Create a Profile with great photos, a bio and more\r\n* Set your preferences for us to show you compatible Muslims\r\n* Start swiping\r\n* Chat, voice call or video call with your matches\r\n*Get married!\r\n---\r\n\r\nSalams is free to download and use for all of our main features. However, if you\u2019re looking to get more out of Salams, you can subscribe to Salams Premium. Prices and features for Salams Premium are clearly displayed in the app. Some things to keep in mind if you decide to subscribe to Salams Premium:\r\n\r\n* Payment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n* Your subscription will automatically renew itself unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n* Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\r\n* You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the iTunes Store.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY\r\nWe take your privacy VERY seriously. We don't post to your Facebook page and we don't share your personal information with other parties. You may delete your Salams account at any time and all of your user information and conversations are instantly deleted.\r\n\r\nPrivacy http://www.salams.app/privacy.html\r\nTerms http://www.salams.app/terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Salams is about bringing Muslims together. Salams is a Muslim dating, friendship and networking app with nearly 4 million Muslims worldwide. Salams has helped over 460,000 Muslim couples and friends. Hamdullah!<br><br>* Salams Love \u2192 Muslim Marriage (i.e. Muslim dating, halal dating)<br>* Salams Connect \u2192 Muslim friendship and networking<br>Download Salams and start matching today to find a Muslim spouse or friend.<br><br>Salams makes Muslim dating (1) halal (2) simple (3) personal (4) safe and secure. Some Salams features to enjoy:<br>* Swipe right if you\u2019re interested or left if you\u2019re not<br>* In-depth profiles with a person\u2019s sect, education, career, height, prayer levels and more!<br>* Free Audio/ video calling<br>* Unlimited messages, matches and calling<br>* User verification process with selfie verification and GPS location<br>* User Endorsements are given by other users to rate profile quality<br>* Screenshot stopper for private dating<br>Salams app features are designed for quality halal conversations. Swipes are anonymous and you\u2019re only matched with someone if they swipe right on you too. When you match, we\u2019ll notify you both and you can start dating!<br><br>We recommend exploring our Salams Gold or Salams Diamond memberships to speed up your matrimonial journey!<br>* Over 17 filters to find the right partner<br>* Profile Boosts to help you stand out from the crowd<br>* Profile Insights that show where you\u2019re most popular, the total number of swipes and more<br>* Anti-Ghost feature to improve responsiveness with your matches<br>* Custom Profile Reviews from our experts to improve your dating profile<br>* Telegrams are like love notes for a more personal touch... and more!<br><br>Salams welcomes all Muslims into a respectful, positive space! Black Muslim, Arab Muslim, Turkish Muslim, Desi Muslim, Asian Muslim or any other ethnicity in this world? Born Muslim or a Muslim revert/ convert or just interested in meeting Muslims? Sunni, Shia, Ahmadi, Ibadi, Bohra or Bahai? Phone call with her Dad? Require a Wali or Just Muslim? Rishta? Shaadi? Nikah? However, you name it. Salams is the app for you!<br><br>Muslims are diverse and so are their ideal relationship paths. Find someone that fits yours and InshAllah you complete half your deen with us!<br><br>Salams has been featured in The New York Times, Vice, The Washington Post, The Jimmy Kimmel Show, The Daily Beast, Der Spiegel and more as a popular approach for Muslim dating!<br><br>How does Salams Love work? Salams Love is for Muslim Dating.<br>* Create a Profile with great photos, a bio and more<br>* Set your preferences for us to show you compatible Muslims<br>* Start swiping<br>* Chat, voice call or video call with your matches<br>*Get married!<br>---<br><br>Salams is free to download and use for all of our main features. However, if you\u2019re looking to get more out of Salams, you can subscribe to Salams Premium. Prices and features for Salams Premium are clearly displayed in the app. Some things to keep in mind if you decide to subscribe to Salams Premium:<br><br>* Payment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.<br>* Your subscription will automatically renew itself unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br>* Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.<br>* You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the iTunes Store.<br><br>PRIVACY<br>We take your privacy VERY seriously. We don&#39;t post to your Facebook page and we don&#39;t share your personal information with other parties. You may delete your Salams account at any time and all of your user information and conversations are instantly deleted.<br><br>Privacy http://www.salams.app/privacy.html<br>Terms http://www.salams.app/terms.html",
